      "content": "but that's just a way to sugarcoat things. it doesn't change the fact that i'm the weak link. in every great story, there comes a point where the rot has to be removed so the rest of the structure can stand strong. if i stay, i'm just a permanent defect in their history. wouldn't it be more honorable to step aside and let the memory of them stay untainted? to leave before i ruin it even more?",
